## Key Learnings
- IAM manages secure access.
- EC2 hosts applications.
- S3 stores static files and backups.
- EBS provides block storage.
- EFS provides shared file storage.
- RDS manages relational databases.
- VPC isolates network resources.
- CloudWatch monitors AWS services.
- ELB distributes traffic.
- Auto Scaling adjusts resources automatically.

